Xeen: no saves while signing in at an inn; load such saves in the town

Signing in at an inn sets the party map to 0 while the party dialog is open.
Saving was allowed then (ScummVM menu, autosave, a backend's suspend save),
and loading that save failed: "Could not open file - maze0000.evt!" and the
debugger. Refuse to save on map 0, and load an existing map-0 save in the
map the party signed in from (_priorMazeId).

diff --git a/engines/mm/xeen/saves.cpp b/engines/mm/xeen/saves.cpp
index 86c3635d..8bf4739f 100644
--- a/engines/mm/xeen/saves.cpp
+++ b/engines/mm/xeen/saves.cpp
@@ -200,6 +200,13 @@ Common::Error SavesManager::loadGameState(int slot) {
 	combat.reset();
 	party._treasure.reset();
 
+	// A save made while signing in at an inn (party dialog open) has map 0,
+	// which does not exist: continue in the inn's town instead.
+	if (party._mazeId == 0 && party._priorMazeId != 0) {
+		warning("Save has no map (made at an inn); continuing in map %d", party._priorMazeId);
+		party._mazeId = party._priorMazeId;
+	}
+
 	// Load the new map
 	map.clearMaze();
 	map._loadCcNum = files._ccNum;
diff --git a/engines/mm/xeen/xeen.cpp b/engines/mm/xeen/xeen.cpp
index fceb3e18..2078aac7 100644
--- a/engines/mm/xeen/xeen.cpp
+++ b/engines/mm/xeen/xeen.cpp
@@ -246,7 +246,9 @@ bool XeenEngine::canLoadGameStateCurrently(Common::U32String *msg) {
 }
 
 bool XeenEngine::canSaveGameStateCurrently(Common::U32String *msg) {
+	// Map 0: the party is signing in at an inn (Locations::Tavern), no map.
 	return _mode != MODE_COMBAT && _mode != MODE_STARTUP && _mode != MODE_SCRIPT_IN_PROGRESS
+		&& _party->_mazeId != 0
 		&& (_map->mazeData()._mazeFlags & RESTRICTION_SAVE) == 0;
 }
 
